1
00:00:11,199 --> 00:00:12,039
General.

2
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,359
My home is heavily guarded.

3
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:22,399
You dare make a move on me here?

4
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,480
When I came in,

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,679
the police had already surrounded the place.

6
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,879
They're all caught! Wrap it up!

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,359
They were taken down long ago.

8
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:38,600
Speak!

9
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,399
Why did you target the Lian family?

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,960
Because of your father, Lian Shanquan.

11
00:00:43,119 --> 00:00:44,359
He refused to submit to me,

12
00:00:44,439 --> 00:00:45,359
so I had to conquer him,

13
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:46,560
conquer the Lian family,

14
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,479
just as Japan is fated to conquer China!

15
00:00:48,479 --> 00:00:49,320
In your dreams!

16
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,679
The Lian family won't lose to you,

17
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,000
Nor will the Chinese lose to Japan!

18
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,599
Speak! Where is Lian Yu?

19
00:01:08,959 --> 00:01:09,760
Just moments ago,

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,439
I had Kobayashi Sachiko

21
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:13,079
send your brother out the secret passage.

22
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,120
Where did you send Lian Yu?

23
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,200
To a madman.

24
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:00,560
Where they'll forever be slaves to Japan.

25
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,360
I'll ask you one more time.

26
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,360
Where is my brother, Lian Yu?

27
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,800
Men made slaves,

28
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,960
women made whores.

29
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,759
Talk! Where's Lian Yu?

30
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,240
Brother Lian!

31
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,000
All of Matsui's men have been taken down.

32
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:11,159
Impossible. Impossible!

33
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:15,360
This kid...

34
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,919
I just saw him.

35
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:17,960
Really.

36
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:21,199
He seemed to head to Rongcheng Station.

37
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:24,199
The license plate is Guo 88909 Rong.

38
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,919
Guo 88909 Rong.

39
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:35,520
Let's go.

40
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,120
Lian Yu!

41
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:49,520
Brother!

42
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,479
Lian Yu!

43
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:53,199
Yuna!

44
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,719
Lian Yu!

45
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,759
Lian Yu!

46
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,080
Yuna!

47
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:04,759
Lian Yu!

48
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,560
Major General.

49
00:04:27,959 --> 00:04:30,399
The night raid failed.

50
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:33,319
Our forces were completely wiped out.

51
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,879
Damn it!

52
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,680
Matsui, that useless fool!

53
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,319
Good for nothing...

54
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,000
and ruins everything!

55
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,600
Who is he?

56
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:51,360
A young slave Mr. Matsui kept captive.

57
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,519
What's your name?

58
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,800
Yuna.

59
00:04:58,279 --> 00:05:00,800
Mr. Matsui named him Matsui Yuna.

60
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,560
He can't speak.

61
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,879
Yuna.

62
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:21,120
Kill!

63
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:26,199
So cute!

64
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,439
Besides the gold bars,

65
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,279
compressed rations,

66
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,959
first-aid kits, and essentials—

67
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:37,279
pack them all in.

68
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:38,839
Yes, Master.

69
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,800
What is going on?

70
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,560
War is coming.

71
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,040
We're running for our lives, of course!

72
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:53,439
I bought tickets to Hong Kong, China.

73
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:55,000
We're leaving today.

74
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:15,959
This money will last you a lifetime.

75
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,839
Go find somewhere to hide.

76
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,279
Thank you, Master.

77
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:38,000
Come on!

78
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:45,839
Let me take it.

79
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,879
Hello. Boat tickets, please.

80
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:55,480
Here you go.

81
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:56,480
All right.

82
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,639
Dad, the suitcase.

83
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,160
Let me grab the tickets.

84
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,040
Okay.

85
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,319
Go on, go on. Hurry up!

86
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,639
Mingyuan, hurry and get on!

87
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,319
Dad, I'm deputy chief of Rongcheng Police.

88
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,800
Protecting the people is my duty.

89
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,439
I can't leave.

90
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,040
Wait for me in Hong Kong, China.

91
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,120
Take care of yourself.

92
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,399
Son!

93
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,279
Mingyuan!

94
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,439
Forget that damn chief job!

95
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:47,160
Leave with me!

96
00:07:47,839 --> 00:07:49,000
Leave with me, Mingyuan!

97
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,399
Time's up. We have to set sail.

98
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:52,839
Don't go! My son isn't on board yet!

99
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,879
You can't leave!

100
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,120
Mingyuan! Mingyuan!

101
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:02,120
You can't leave me behind, Mingyuan!

102
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,279
My son! My son!

103
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,680
You can't leave me behind, Mingyuan!

104
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,079
Mingyuan!

105
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:26,959
April 19, 1941.

106
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:30,160
Under the cover of naval gunfire,

107
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,240
at Changle and Lianjiang,

108
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,759
the Japanese made multi-pronged landings.

109
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,200
The Japanese seized fishing boats

110
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,679
from islands along the Min River estuary.

111
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,240
Fishermen clashed with the Japanese,

112
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,600
suffering heavy casualties.

113
00:08:46,519 --> 00:08:48,759
Warships in the Min River estuary

114
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:51,000
patrolled along the northern coast.

115
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,679
All-out war is imminent.

116
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,159
I called everyone here today

117
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:57,960
to make an announcement.

118
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:00,360
Lian Ye.

119
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:02,840
Come over here.

120
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:16,559
Everyone, Japan attacked Rongcheng today.

121
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:19,159
This dance hall can't protect any of you.

122
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,559
Thank you all for the past three years,

123
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:23,080
and everything you've given to this hall.

124
00:09:23,519 --> 00:09:24,440
Without you,

125
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:26,200
there would be no Chen Dieyi today.

126
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,279
Here is severance pay for everyone.

127
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:31,799
Take it and run for your lives.

128
00:09:35,159 --> 00:09:35,919
Reporting, Commander!

129
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,840
The Japanese breached the Min River line,

130
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,679
and landed on Jiadeng and Langqi islands.

131
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,440
Reporting, Commander!

132
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,240
The Japanese took Changle and Lianjiang,

133
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,679
and are pushing toward downtown Rongcheng!

134
00:09:53,399 --> 00:09:56,519
I'm old, and my mind isn't as sharp.

135
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:59,200
I can't lead the Sanshan Gang brothers

136
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,360
to break through and survive.

137
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:03,960
You found Chief Hu's real killer.

138
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:07,440
Your capability is clear to all.

139
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,480
From this day forth,

140
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:12,919
you are the Chief of the Sanshan Gang.

141
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,559
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

142
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:25,919
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

143
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,440
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

144
00:10:27,759 --> 00:10:28,759
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

145
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,519
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

146
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,440
When the war ends

147
00:10:34,039 --> 00:10:35,600
and the dance hall reopens,

148
00:10:35,799 --> 00:10:37,200
you are all welcome to come back.

149
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,679
Thank you, Sister Dieyi.

150
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:40,960
Reporting, General!

151
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:41,919
A telegram from headquarters.

152
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,519
Downtown Rongcheng is unfit for battle,

153
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,679
ordering us to withdraw to Dahu, Minhou,

154
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:45,799
and hold the Gutian mountains.

155
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:48,399
Move out! Any later and it'll be too late!

156
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,559
General,

157
00:10:55,159 --> 00:10:57,200
how can the police help the war effort?

158
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:24,919
Yan Baichuan pays respects to Chief Lian.

159
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:27,080
Greetings, Chief Lian!

160
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,720
Greetings, Chief Lian!

161
00:11:32,919 --> 00:11:33,799
My thanks to you all.

162
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:38,519
I, Lian Ye, hereby swear,

163
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:43,279
to give my all for the Sanshan Gang,

164
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,039
until my dying breath!

165
00:11:55,559 --> 00:11:56,440
This is for you.

166
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:59,519
Sister Dieyi, I don't want to leave.

167
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,480
I want to stay with you forever.

168
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,240
Bailing,

169
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:11,759
you're still young.

170
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:15,360
It's dangerous to stay with me.

171
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,440
Hide far away.

172
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:22,000
Never let anyone find you.

173
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,240
Remember what I said.

174
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,279
Our top priority right now

175
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,600
is to keep the Sanshan Gang and fishermen

176
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:34,440
from clashing directly with the Japanese.

177
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,000
Pass down the order.

178
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:37,960
First,

179
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:40,720
the Japanese are seizing our fishing boats

180
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,559
to cut off the islands' connection

181
00:12:43,559 --> 00:12:44,559
with Rongcheng.

182
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,360
Tell the fishermen to hide their boats

183
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,799
for emergencies.

184
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,440
Mingyuan,

185
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,360
you heard it just now.

186
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:54,639
At their current marching pace,

187
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:57,600
they will cross the Wulong River tomorrow

188
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,240
and march straight into Rongcheng.

189
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:02,480
Why don't you join us

190
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,639
and fall back to Dahu, Minhou?

191
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:10,240
Second, the garrison defends Rongcheng.

192
00:13:10,919 --> 00:13:12,399
The civilians are unarmed;

193
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:15,279
they can't fight the Japanese directly.

194
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,200
Thank you, Commander.

195
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,879
I'm a native of Rongcheng.

196
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:21,759
Defending Rongcheng is my duty.

197
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,200
Finally,

198
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,799
the Japanese

199
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:29,519
will surely cut off our food and supplies.

200
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:33,879
Stockpile grain and prepare for battle!
